>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `LINARITH_ext_ss_with`

``` hol4
linarithLib.LINARITH_ext_ss_with : thm list -> simpExtLib.ssfrag
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Provides `LINARITH_ext_ss` with an explicit list of `[arith]` facts.

`LINARITH_ext_ss_with facts` is the fragment of
[`LINARITH_ext_ss`](#linarithLib.LINARITH_ext_ss) whose facts are exactly
`facts`: the global `[arith]` set is not read, whatever
it holds.

### Failure

As for [`LINARITH_ext_ss`](#linarithLib.LINARITH_ext_ss).

### See also

[`linarithLib.LINARITH_ext_ss`](#linarithLib.LINARITH_ext_ss),
[`linarithLib.linarith_solver_with_facts`](#linarithLib.linarith_solver_with_facts),
[`linarithData.arith`](#linarithData.arith)
